{"unit_id":"nzl153__dsh-prompt-suggestions#card-zh","repo":"nzl153/dsh-prompt-suggestions","commit":"371e1dbe77ef3d2e3004bec92f3a0aa0eefe98cb","type":"card","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-prompt-suggestions 是面向 DSH 网页及桌面端输入框的下一句建议插件。它通过服务端会话接口读取最近的用户和助手文本，并调用 DSH 已配置的模型，在助手回复结束且输入框为空时生成一句可能的后续消息。建议以灰色占位文字显示，按 Tab 可填入，按 Esc 可忽略；输入法组字和命令菜单打开时会保留原有按键行为。每条助手回复的结果按会话缓存，避免重复请求。适合希望更快续写对话的 DSH 用户；需要 DSH 中有可用的 flash 模型，或同时配置 provider 与 model。","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/index.mjs:48-76","lib/index.mjs:118-159","lib/client.js:61-171"]}
{"unit_id":"nzl153__dsh-prompt-suggestions#card-en","repo":"nzl153/dsh-prompt-suggestions","commit":"371e1dbe77ef3d2e3004bec92f3a0aa0eefe98cb","type":"card","lang":"en","text":"dsh-prompt-suggestions predicts a short follow-up from recent conversation text using the DSH model. It shows the suggestion in the empty web or desktop composer; Tab inserts it and Escape dismisses it. A flash model is found automatically, or provider and model can be configured together.","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/index.mjs:48-76","lib/index.mjs:118-159","lib/client.js:61-171"]}
