{"unit_id":"nzl153__dsh-prompt-suggestions#feature-1","repo":"nzl153/dsh-prompt-suggestions","commit":"371e1dbe77ef3d2e3004bec92f3a0aa0eefe98cb","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-prompt-suggestions 的功能「预测下一条消息」：助手回复完成后，插件结合当前会话最近几轮文字生成一句可能的用户后续消息；输入框非空或助手仍在处理时不显示建议。","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/index.mjs:31-42","lib/index.mjs:89-108","lib/index.mjs:118-130"]}
{"unit_id":"nzl153__dsh-prompt-suggestions#feature-2","repo":"nzl153/dsh-prompt-suggestions","commit":"371e1dbe77ef3d2e3004bec92f3a0aa0eefe98cb","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-prompt-suggestions 的功能「Tab 接受建议」：建议显示在空输入框的占位位置时，用户按 Tab 即可把整句插入草稿；输入法组字期间或命令、引用菜单打开时不会拦截 Tab。","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/client.js:84-120","lib/client.js:150-171"]}
{"unit_id":"nzl153__dsh-prompt-suggestions#feature-3","repo":"nzl153/dsh-prompt-suggestions","commit":"371e1dbe77ef3d2e3004bec92f3a0aa0eefe98cb","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-prompt-suggestions 的功能「隐藏当前建议」：用户按 Esc 可忽略当前建议；一旦开始输入，建议随即隐藏，清空草稿后会重新请求或显示结果。","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/client.js:88-96","lib/client.js:150-171"]}
{"unit_id":"nzl153__dsh-prompt-suggestions#feature-4","repo":"nzl153/dsh-prompt-suggestions","commit":"371e1dbe77ef3d2e3004bec92f3a0aa0eefe98cb","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-prompt-suggestions 的功能「按会话缓存」：同一会话的同一条助手回复只触发一次模型预测，前端重复请求时复用进行中或已完成的结果，减少重复调用。","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/index.mjs:118-136"]}
{"unit_id":"nzl153__dsh-prompt-suggestions#caveat-1","repo":"nzl153/dsh-prompt-suggestions","commit":"371e1dbe77ef3d2e3004bec92f3a0aa0eefe98cb","type":"caveat","lang":"zh","text":"建议生成会把当前会话最近几轮的文本发给 DSH 当前配置的模型服务处理；接口由 DSH 服务端提供，插件使用该服务而不自行配置密钥。","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/index.mjs:31-42","lib/index.mjs:48-76","lib/index.mjs:118-130"]}
